<title>USA: Snyder Communications buys Good Neighbor.</title>
<headline>Snyder Communications buys Good Neighbor.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snyder Communications Inc said Friday it acquired Good Neighbor Direct.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Good Neighbor Direct provides marketing services through information centers in over 5,000 targeted retail outlets around the United States.</p>
<p>Snyder said the acquisition of Good Neighbor Direct represents a venue for Snyder to provide targeted marketing services to Fortune 500 companies looking to reach potential customers more effectively.</p>
</text>
